id: god-of-survival
name: God of Survival
optionOf: divine-magic
description: Steadfast Checks 2 higher, and Surgency half your Insight Modifier higher.
text: >
  God of Survival [Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 2 and increase your Surgency by 1/2
  (rounded up) of your Insight Modifier.

---

[passive]
steadfast.dice += 2;
surgency += ceil(insight.mod / 2);
